1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:02,721
Potassium iodide is special.

2
00:00:02,721 --> 00:00:11,510
It reduces copper two to copper one: a white precipitate of copper one iodide, coloured brown by the iodine released.

3
00:00:11,510 --> 00:00:13,450
Cyanide does the same.

4
00:00:13,450 --> 00:00:17,669
And iron or zinc displaces red brown copper metal.

